# SurveyForge release repository
#
# This repository publishes the V2 implementation as the formal 1.0 version.
# Legacy root-level V1/debug files are intentionally ignored.

*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!README_CN.md
!LICENSE
!requirements.txt
!.env.example

!v2/
!v2/**

# Secrets
.env
v2/.env

# Runtime outputs
data/
logs/
temp/
final/
papers/
v2/temp/
v2/final/
v2/papers/

# Python caches
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Local/IDE files
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
